# What docker build never sends (deploy/Dockerfile builds from the repository root). Keep keys and local state out.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
frontend/dist
deploy/environments/*.local.conf
deploy/environments/*.url
docs
.DS_Store
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
